    "NVIDIA 的模型，最多分 8 人。英文會議的測試（AMI）中，沒被插話的句子標對 77% → 90%；中文會議會分出比較多人，還在觀察。超過 8 人的會議、模型還沒下載好時用標準的。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NVIDIA 的模型，最多分 8 人。英文会议的测试（AMI）中，没被插话的句子标对 77% → 90%；中文会议会分出比较多人，还在观察。超过 8 人的会议、模型还没下载好时用标准的。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A model from NVIDIA that tells up to 8 people apart. In English meeting tests (AMI), sentences without crosstalk were labeled correctly 90% of the time instead of 77%; in Chinese meetings it finds more people, which is still being evaluated. Meetings with more than 8 people, or before the model has downloaded, use Standard."
          }
        }
      }
    },
