    "Zoom、Teams、Webex、Google Meet（瀏覽器）等開始用麥克風、拾音沒在錄音時提醒你，不會自動開始錄音。會議 app 停止用麥克風時倒數 60 秒，沒按「繼續錄」就停止並轉錄；關掉「自動停止」時只問要不要停止。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zoom、Teams、Webex、Google Meet（浏览器）等开始用麦克风、拾音没在录音时提醒你，不会自动开始录音。会议 app 停止用麦克风时倒数 60 秒，没按“继续录”就停止并转录；关掉“自动停止”时只问要不要停止。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When Zoom, Teams, Webex, Google Meet (in a browser) or another meeting app starts using the microphone and KelNote isn't recording, KelNote asks whether to record; it never starts recording on its own. When the meeting app stops using the microphone, a 60-second countdown starts and the recording stops and is transcribed unless you click Keep Recording. With automatic stop turned off, KelNote only asks whether to stop."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zoom、Teams、Webex、Google Meet（瀏覽器）等開始用麥克風、KelNote 沒在錄音時提醒你，不會自動開始錄音。會議 app 停止用麥克風時倒數 60 秒，沒按「繼續錄」就停止並轉錄；關掉「自動停止」時只問要不要停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
