    },
    "「%@」開不起來（虛擬裝置或被別的 app 佔住），這場錄音改用「%@」。可以在設定 → 錄音換掉。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%1$@” couldn't start (a virtual device, or in use by another app), so this recording uses “%2$@”. You can change it in Settings → Recording."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@”开不起来（虚拟装置或被别的 app 占住），这场录音改用“%@”。可以在设置 → 录音换掉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「一般」的「分享畫面時藏起拾音的視窗」：打開後，用 Zoom、Teams、Google Meet 分享整個螢幕時別人看不到拾音，截圖、螢幕錄影也拍不到。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "General, “Hide KelNote's windows when sharing the screen”: when on, people can't see KelNote when you share your whole screen in Zoom, Teams, or Google Meet, and screenshots and screen recordings won't show it either."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“一般”的“分享画面时藏起拾音的窗口”：打开后，用 Zoom、Teams、Google Meet 分享整个屏幕时别人看不到拾音，截图、屏幕录像也拍不到。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「一般」的「分享畫面時藏起 KelNote 的視窗」：打開後，用 Zoom、Teams、Google Meet 分享整個螢幕時別人看不到 KelNote，截圖、螢幕錄影也拍不到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「企業伺服器」：公司的伺服器、你的帳號，可以選要不要用它轉錄、整理，或登出。整理工具選「公司」就用公司設定的模型。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Enterprise server”: your company’s server and your account. Choose whether to use it for transcription and summaries, or sign out. With the “Company” summarizer, notes are written by the model your company set up."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“企业服务器”：公司的服务器、你的账号，可以选要不要用它转录、整理，或退出登录。整理工具选“公司”就用公司设置的模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「整理工具」：選 Claude、Codex（需要先安裝並登入對應的 CLI），或填 Anthropic、OpenAI 的 API key。覺得整理太慢，可以在「模型」填比較快的模型，例如 sonnet。「範本」那一頁內建五種；也可以複製一份來改，或自己新增段落與指示。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Summarizer: choose Claude or Codex (install and sign in to the CLI first), or enter an Anthropic or OpenAI API key. If summarizing feels slow, enter a faster model under Model, such as sonnet. The Templates page has five built in; copy one to customize it, or add your own sections and instructions."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“整理工具”：选 Claude、Codex（需要先安装并登录对应的 CLI），或填 Anthropic、OpenAI 的 API key。觉得整理太慢，可以在“模型”填比较快的模型，例如 sonnet。“模板”那一页内建五种；也可以复制一份来改，或自己添加段落与指示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「檢查與更新」：檢查更新（有新版時拾音會詢問，同意後自動下載、驗證並重新打開；也可以從「拾音」選單選「檢查更新…」）、環境檢查；錄音和模型佔用的空間在「模型與空間」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Status & Updates: check for updates (when a new version is available KelNote asks, then downloads, verifies and relaunches; also available from the KelNote menu → Check for Updates…), and the environment check; the space used by recordings and models is under Models & Storage."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“检查与更新”：检查更新（有新版时拾音会询问，同意后自动下载、验证并重新打开；也可以从“拾音”菜单选“检查更新…”）、环境检查；录音和模型占用的空间在“模型与空间”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「檢查與更新」：檢查更新（有新版時 KelNote 會詢問，同意後自動下載、驗證並重新打開；也可以從「KelNote」選單選「檢查更新…」）、環境檢查；錄音和模型佔用的空間在「模型與空間」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「說話者」「詞彙表」：拾音認識的人和他們的聲紋，可以改名、刪除，或關掉記住聲音的功能；詞彙表加入系統名、產品名、人名的正確寫法，這對專有名詞的正確率影響很大。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Speakers and Glossary: the people KelNote recognizes and their voiceprints, which you can rename or delete, or turn off remembering voices; the glossary holds the correct spelling of system names, product names and people's names, which greatly improves proper-noun accuracy."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“说话者”“词汇表”：拾音认识的人和他们的声纹，可以改名、删除，或关掉记住声音的功能；词汇表加入系统名、产品名、人名的正确写法，这对专有名词的正确率影响很大。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「說話者」「詞彙表」：KelNote 認識的人和他們的聲紋，可以改名、刪除，或關掉記住聲音的功能；詞彙表加入系統名、產品名、人名的正確寫法，這對專有名詞的正確率影響很大。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「錄音」「轉錄」：錄音來源和麥克風、線上會議的提醒和快捷鍵；會議語言、正式轉錄的引擎、要不要即時逐字稿和說話者辨識（轉錄模型在「模型與空間」下載）。「正式轉錄」可以選 Breeze ASR 25（建議，聯發科的台灣模型，會參考詞彙表）、Qwen3-ASR（阿里巴巴開源，多人會議漏字少，全程本機）或 macOS 內建（不用下載模型、速度快，但英文專有名詞比較容易錯）。「說話者辨識的模型」可以選 Nemotron-3（實驗性，英文會議分得比較準，最多分 8 人）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recording and Transcription: audio source and microphone, online-meeting alerts and shortcuts; meeting language, the final-transcription engine, live transcript and speaker identification (download transcription models under Models & Storage). Final transcription can use Breeze ASR 25 (recommended; MediaTek's Taiwanese model, uses your glossary), Qwen3-ASR (open-sourced by Alibaba; drops fewer words in multi-speaker meetings, runs entirely on this Mac), or the macOS built-in recognizer (no model download and fast, but English terms are more often wrong). Speaker recognition model can be set to Nemotron-3 (experimental; tells speakers apart more accurately in English meetings, up to 8 people)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“录音”“转录”：录音来源和麦克风、线上会议的提醒和快捷键；会议语言、正式转录的引擎、要不要实时逐字稿和说话者识别（转录模型在“模型与空间”下载）。“正式转录”可以选 Breeze ASR 25（建议，联发科的台湾模型，会参考词汇表）、Qwen3-ASR（阿里巴巴开源，多人会议漏字少，全程本地）或 macOS 内建（不用下载模型、速度快，但英文专有名词比较容易错）。“说话者识别的模型”可以选 Nemotron-3（实验性，英文会议分得比较准，最多分 8 人）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "・": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {}
    },
