    "他說的話還不多。按「補充背景」填他的角色和你知道的事，分析會準一些。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There’s not much to go on yet. Use Add context to enter their role and what you know — the analysis will be more accurate."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "他说的话还不多。按“补充背景”填他的角色和你知道的事，分析会准一些。"
