    "你的聲音出現在至少兩場會議（每場至少說話 60 秒）後，這裡會顯示你在會議裡的表現和趨勢。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的声音出现在至少两场会议（每场至少说话 60 秒）后，这里会显示你在会议里的表现和趋势。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once your voice is in at least two meetings (speaking 60 seconds or more in each), this shows how you do in meetings and how that is changing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
