    "來回對話，不是獨白": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "来回对话，不是独白"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Back-and-forth, not monologues"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例如「HKJC 客戶」「IBM 團隊」「面試者」。把人拖進群組，或在人的選單選「移到群組」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For example “HKJC client”, “IBM team”, “Candidates”. Drag people into the group, or use “Move to Group” in a person’s menu."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例如“HKJC 客户”“IBM 团队”“面试者”。把人拖进群组，或在人的菜单选“移到群组”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例如「HKJC 客戶」「IBM 團隊」「面試者」。這個人會放進新群組。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For example “HKJC client”, “IBM team”, “Candidates”. This person goes into the new group."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例如“HKJC 客户”“IBM 团队”“面试者”。这个人会放进新群组。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例如客戶名稱；之後可以在裡面建案子的子資料夾。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For example a client or account name. You can add project sub-folders inside it later."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例如客户名称；之后可以在里面建案子的子文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例如專案名稱或客戶名稱。這 %lld 場會議會移進新資料夾。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例如项目名称或客户名称。这 %lld 场会议会移进新文件夹。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "For example, a project or client name. This meeting will be moved into the new folder."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "For example, a project or client name. These %lld meetings will be moved into the new folder."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例如專案名稱或客戶名稱。這場會議會移進新資料夾。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For example, a project or client name. This meeting will be moved into the new folder."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例如项目名称或客户名称。这场会议会移进新文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例如案子名稱。在「%@」看得到所有子資料夾的會議。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For example a project name. “%@” shows the meetings in all its sub-folders."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例如案子名称。在“%@”看得到所有子文件夹的会议。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例如：「上個月跟客戶談過哪些價格？」「寄信的機制最後怎麼決定的？」拾音會先找出相關的會議片段，再請整理工具回答，回答附上是哪一場會議、哪個時間點。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For example: “What prices did we discuss with clients last month?” or “What did we decide about sending email?” KelNote first finds the relevant parts of your meetings, then asks the summarizer. Answers show which meeting and what time each point comes from."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例如：“上个月跟客户谈过哪些价格？”“寄信的机制最后怎么决定的？”拾音会先找出相关的会议片段，再请整理工具回答，回答附上是哪一场会议、哪个时间点。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例如：「上個月跟客戶談過哪些價格？」「寄信的機制最後怎麼決定的？」KelNote 會先找出相關的會議片段，再請整理工具回答，回答附上是哪一場會議、哪個時間點。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例如：「誰負責寄信的部分？」「最後決定的上線日期是哪一天？」回答只根據這場會議的會議紀錄和逐字稿，每一點都附上時間，點了就能聽原話。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For example: “Who's handling the email part?” or “What launch date did we settle on?” Answers use only this meeting's notes and transcript, and every point has a time you can click to hear what was said."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例如：“谁负责寄信的部分？”“最后决定的上线日期是哪一天？”回答只根据这场会议的会议记录和逐字稿，每一点都附上时间，点了就能听原话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例如：「這個專案目前的進度和風險？」「有哪些還沒完成的待辦？」拾音會帶上這個資料夾每一場會議的紀錄，再加上跟問題有關的逐字稿片段，請整理工具回答。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For example: “What’s the current status and risk on this project?” “Which action items are still open?” KelNote sends the notes of every meeting in this folder, plus transcript excerpts related to your question, and the answer cites the meeting and time."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例如：“这个项目目前的进度和风险？”“有哪些还没完成的待办？”拾音会带上这个文件夹每一场会议的记录，再加上跟问题有关的逐字稿片段，请整理工具回答。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例如：「這個專案目前的進度和風險？」「有哪些還沒完成的待辦？」KelNote 會帶上這個資料夾每一場會議的紀錄，再加上跟問題有關的逐字稿片段，請整理工具回答。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例如：列出討論中提到的風險、負責人和期限。可以分行，用 - 條列。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例如：列出讨论中提到的风险、负责人和期限。可以分行，用 - 条列。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For example: list the risks raised, with owners and deadlines. You can use several lines and - for bullets."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例如：向誰報告、在意什麼指標、跟我們合作的歷史、私下聊過的事": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "e.g. reporting line, metrics they care about, history with us, things discussed offline"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例如：向谁报告、在意什么指标、跟我们合作的历史、私下聊过的事"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例如：小明": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For example: Alex"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例如：小明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例如：補上為什麼這樣決定；日期是 12 月 3 日不是 11 月 3 日": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For example: add why this was decided; the date is 3 December, not 3 November"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例如：补上为什么这样决定；日期是 12 月 3 日不是 11 月 3 日"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例如：週會、sync（任一個詞）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例如：周会、sync（任一个词）"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "e.g. weekly, sync (any of the words)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例如：週會、專案會議用": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例如：周会、项目会议用"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For example: weekly and project meetings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例如：預算的討論寫得太簡略，補上數字和誰負責；Sandy 的職稱是 Head of Claims，不是 Claims Lead": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For example: the budget discussion is too brief, add the figures and who owns it; Sandy's title is Head of Claims, not Claims Lead"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例如：预算的讨论写得太简略，补上数字和谁负责；Sandy 的职称是 Head of Claims，不是 Claims Lead"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例如：風險": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例如：风险"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For example: Risks"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "依各檔案的檔名或修改日期": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "From each file's name or modification date"
          }
        },
