    "到「設定 → 說話者 → 我的聲音」錄一段自己的聲音（照著畫面上的文字唸約 20 秒），第一場會議就認得你：聲音像你的說話者會直接帶入你的名字，沒把握時在待確認問你。錄音只用來算聲音特徵，算完就刪掉。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Record your own voice in Settings → Speakers → My voice (read the passage on screen for about 20 seconds), and KelNote recognizes you from your first meeting: a speaker who sounds like you gets your name, or KelNote asks you in the questions to confirm when it isn't sure. The recording is used only to work out your voice profile and is deleted right after."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "到“设置 → 说话者 → 我的声音”录一段自己的声音（照着画面上的文字念约 20 秒），第一场会议就认得你：声音像你的说话者会直接带入你的名字，没把握时在待确认问你。录音只用来算声音特征，算完就删掉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "到設定的「模型與空間」下載": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Download it in Settings → Models & Storage"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "到设置的“模型与空间”下载"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "到設定的「模型與空間」下載，或在「轉錄」把正式轉錄改成 macOS 內建": {
