    "告訴整理工具哪裡要補細節、哪裡不正確。它會對照逐字稿和參考文件，只改你提到的地方。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tell the AI what needs more detail or is wrong. It checks the transcript and reference documents and changes only what you mention."
          }
