    "打開後，用 Zoom、Teams、Google Meet 分享整個螢幕時，別人看不到拾音（例如其他會議的紀錄）。截圖、螢幕錄影也拍不到拾音。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开后，用 Zoom、Teams、Google Meet 分享整个屏幕时，别人看不到拾音（例如其他会议的记录）。截图、屏幕录像也拍不到拾音。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, people can't see KelNote (for example, notes from other meetings) when you share your whole screen in Zoom, Teams, or Google Meet. Screenshots and screen recordings won't show KelNote either."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打開後，用 Zoom、Teams、Google Meet 分享整個螢幕時，別人看不到 KelNote （例如其他會議的紀錄）。截圖、螢幕錄影也拍不到 KelNote。"
