    "會議紀錄（摘要、決議、待辦、心智圖）用這個語言寫；逐字稿仍然照會議語言。每場會議也可以在會議頁的範本選單另外選。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meeting notes (summary, decisions, action items, mind map) are written in this language; the transcript stays in the meeting language. You can also pick a different one per meeting from the template menu on the meeting page."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
