            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switches per 5 min"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每一種東西都可以直接改：側欄的會議、資料夾、人物按右鍵，或滑鼠移上去時右邊的「⋯」；選到時按 Return 重新命名、按 Delete 刪除。會議紀錄的每一條雙擊就能改，按右鍵可以刪掉那一條（改錯了用「會議 → 復原上一版會議紀錄」）。會議頁上方的說話者點名字就能重新命名。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每一种东西都可以直接改：侧边栏的会议、文件夹、人物按右键，或鼠标移上去时右边的“⋯”；选到时按 Return 重新命名、按 Delete 删除。会议记录的每一条双击就能改，按右键可以删掉那一条（改错了用“会议 → 恢复上一版会议记录”）。会议页上方的说话者点名字就能重新命名。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can change anything in place: right-click a meeting, folder or person in the sidebar, or use the “⋯” that appears when you hover; with one selected, press Return to rename it or Delete to delete it. Double-click any item in the meeting notes to edit it, or right-click to delete it (if you make a mistake, choose Meeting → Revert to Previous Notes). Click a speaker’s name at the top of a meeting to rename them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每個人的重點": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个人的重点"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Key points by person"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每個人都從他出現過的所有會議重新分析": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Re-analyze each person from every meeting they were in"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个人都从他出现过的所有会议重新分析"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每個人都從他出現過的所有會議重新分析，用 %@ 每人呼叫一次，大約半分鐘一位，在背景進行。你填的背景會保留。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each person is re-analyzed from every meeting they were in — one %@ call per person, about 30 seconds each, in the background. Context you entered is kept."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个人都从他出现过的所有会议重新分析，用 %@ 每人呼叫一次，大约半分钟一位，在背景进行。你填的背景会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每個自訂段落是會議紀錄裡的一節，整理工具照「要寫什麼」寫成條列；負責人、期限這類待辦，請打開上面的「待辦」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个自定义段落是会议记录里的一节，整理工具照“要写什么”写成条列；负责人、期限这类待办，请打开上面的“待办”。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each custom section becomes a section of the notes, written as a list following What to write. For action items with owners and due dates, turn on Action items above."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每分鐘口頭禪": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每分钟口头禅"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fillers per minute"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每場會議整理完都更新與會者的利害關係人分析": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Update attendees’ stakeholder analysis after every meeting"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每场会议整理完都更新与会者的利害关系人分析"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每天送一份匿名的使用統計給拾音的開發者：版本、系統、錄音和轉錄了幾分鐘、用了哪些功能、失敗幾次和哪一種失敗。不會送會議標題、逐字稿、會議紀錄、人名、聲紋或任何檔案。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once a day, KelNote sends its developer an anonymous summary: version, system, minutes recorded and transcribed, which features were used, and how many tasks failed and of what kind. It never sends meeting titles, transcripts, notes, names, voiceprints or any files."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每天送一份匿名的使用统计给拾音的开发者：版本、系统、录音和转录了几分钟、用了哪些功能、失败几次和哪一种失败。不会送会议标题、逐字稿、会议记录、人名、声纹或任何文件。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每天送一份匿名的使用統計給 KelNote 的開發者：版本、系統、錄音和轉錄了幾分鐘、用了哪些功能、失敗幾次和哪一種失敗。不會送會議標題、逐字稿、會議紀錄、人名、聲紋或任何檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每天送一份匿名的使用統計（版本、系統、錄音和轉錄的分鐘數、用了哪些功能、失敗的次數和種類），不含任何會議內容。在設定 → 一般可以關掉。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once a day, KelNote sends an anonymous usage summary (version, system, minutes recorded and transcribed, which features were used, and how many tasks failed and of what kind) that never includes meeting content. You can turn it off in Settings → General."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每天送一份匿名的使用统计（版本、系统、录音和转录的分钟数、用了哪些功能、失败的次数和种类），不含任何会议内容。在设置 → 一般可以关掉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每換一行會自動加上當下的錄音時間；整理時會優先納入這些內容。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each new line gets the current recording time. These notes are prioritized when summarizing."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每换一行会自动加上当下的录音时间；整理时会优先纳入这些内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
