    "範本、會議語言、大約幾個人。人多、吵雜或手機放在桌上錄音時，先告訴拾音大約幾個人，說話者會分得比較準": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模板、会议语言、大约几个人。人多、吵杂或手机放在桌上录音时，先告诉拾音大约几个人，说话者会分得比较准"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Template, meeting language and about how many people. When there are many people, it's noisy, or the phone is on the table, tell KelNote about how many people there are so speakers are separated better"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "範本、會議語言、大約幾個人。人多、吵雜或手機放在桌上錄音時，先告訴 KelNote 大約幾個人，說話者會分得比較準"
