          }
        }
      }
    },
    "精簡版用整理工具去掉「嗯、呃、那個」這類贅字、重複的字詞和說到一半改口的部分，不改意思、不摘要。每一句的時間和說話者不變。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "精简版用整理工具去掉“嗯、呃、那个”这类赘字、重复的字词和说到一半改口的部分，不改意思、不摘要。每一句的时间和说话者不变。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The clean version uses your summarizer to remove filler words like “um” and “uh”, repeated words and false starts, without changing the meaning or summarizing. Each line keeps its time and speaker."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "精簡：用整理工具去掉贅字、重複和改口的版本；播放、搜尋、匯出照舊用原文": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "精简：用整理工具去掉赘字、重复和改口的版本；播放、搜索、导出照旧用原文"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Clean: a version without filler words, repetitions and false starts, made by your summarizer. Playback, search and export still use the original"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "系統": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "System"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "系統名、產品名、人名的正確寫法。轉錄時會當成提示（最多約 150 字），整理時也會參考。實驗顯示，有沒有詞彙提示，專有名詞的正確率差很多。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Correct spellings of system, product and people's names. They're given to transcription as a hint (up to about 150 characters) and used when summarizing. In tests, the glossary made a big difference for proper nouns."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统名、产品名、人名的正确写法。转录时会当成提示（最多约 150 字），整理时也会参考。实验显示，有没有词汇提示，专有名词的正确率差很多。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
