    "超過 15 秒沒有收到系統聲音：請確認線上會議有聲音，並在「系統設定 → 隱私權與安全性 → 錄製螢幕與系統錄音」允許拾音": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No system audio for over 15 seconds. Check that the meeting is playing sound and that KelNote is allowed in System Settings → Privacy & Security → Screen & System Audio Recording."
          }
        },
