    "這句和之後的逐字稿、錄音、標記重點、畫面變成新的一場，前面的留在這場；我的筆記、參考文件、提問留在這場。兩場都要重新整理會議紀錄。30 天內可以從「更多」還原。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这句和之后的逐字稿、录音、标记重点、画面变成新的一场，前面的留在这场；我的笔记、参考文档、提问留在这场。两场都要重新整理会议记录。30 天内可以从“更多”还原。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This line and everything after it in the transcript, recording, bookmarks and screens becomes a new meeting; everything before stays here, along with My Notes, documents and questions. Both meetings need their notes rewritten. You can restore it from More within 30 days."
          }
        }
      }
    },
