    "錄音時間軸": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recording timeline"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "录音时间轴"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音會交給公司的伺服器轉錄。要改回這台 Mac，到「設定 → 企業伺服器」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recordings will be transcribed on your company's server. To switch back to this Mac, go to Settings → Enterprise server."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "录音会交给公司的服务器转录。要改回这台 Mac，到“设置 → 企业服务器”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音會先存好，下次開啟拾音時開始轉錄。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The recording will be saved and transcribed the next time you open KelNote."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "录音会先存好，下次打开拾音时开始转录。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "錄音會先存好，下次開啟 KelNote 時開始轉錄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音會送到 %@（公司的伺服器）轉錄，轉完就刪；說話者辨識和聲紋在這台 Mac 上做，聲紋不會送出。會參考詞彙表。連不上時會等，也可以改在這台 Mac 轉錄。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recordings are sent to %@ (your company's server) for transcription and deleted afterwards; speaker identification and voiceprints stay on this Mac. Uses the glossary. If the server can't be reached, KelNote waits, or you can transcribe on this Mac instead."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "录音会送到 %@（公司的服务器）转录，转完就删；说话者识别和声纹在这台 Mac 上做，声纹不会送出。会参考词汇表。连不上时会等，也可以改在这台 Mac 转录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音檔太小，沒有內容": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
