    "鑰匙圈裡已經有舊的 key，macOS 沒有讓拾音取代它。請打開「鑰匙圈存取」，刪除「拾音 API key（%@）」後再存一次。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The keychain already has an older key, and macOS didn’t let KelNote replace it. Open Keychain Access, delete “KelNote API key (%@)”, then save again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "钥匙串里已经有旧的 key，macOS 没有让拾音取代它。请打开“钥匙串访问”，删除“拾音 API key（%@）”后再存一次。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "鑰匙圈裡已經有舊的 key，macOS 沒有讓 KelNote 取代它。請打開「鑰匙圈存取」，刪除「KelNote API key（%@）」後再存一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "長度（長的在前）": {
