    "開始重新分析 %lld 個人，每人大約半分鐘，在背景進行": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Re-analyzing %lld people in the background, about 30 seconds each"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开始重新分析 %lld 个人，每人大约半分钟，在背景进行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開始錄音": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start Recording"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开始录音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開始錄音後聽約 10 秒，判斷是哪一種語言（%@）；跟會議語言不同而且有把握時會自動切換，錄音畫面可以改回來。需要 60 MB 的語言偵測模型。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After recording starts, listens for about 10 seconds to tell which language is spoken (%@). If it differs from the meeting language and the result is confident, it switches automatically; you can switch back on the recording screen. Needs the 60 MB language detection model."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开始录音后听约 10 秒，判断是哪一种语言（%@）；跟会议语言不同而且有把握时会自动切换，录音画面可以改回来。需要 60 MB 的语言检测模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開始錄音（⌘R），用%@辨識；點右邊的箭頭可以改錄音來源和語言": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start recording (⌘R) in %@; click the arrow to change the recording source and language"
          }
