    "麥克風": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Microphone"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "麦克风"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "麥克風一直在重新連接，錄音可能斷斷續續。藍牙耳機的麥克風常這樣，可以點上面的麥克風名稱換成內建麥克風。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "麦克风一直在重新连接，录音可能断断续续。蓝牙耳机的麦克风常这样，可以点上面的麦克风名称换成内建麦克风。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The microphone keeps reconnecting, so the recording may have gaps. Bluetooth headset microphones often do this. Click the microphone name above to switch to the built-in microphone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "麥克風已暫停": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "麦克风已暂停"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Microphone paused"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "麥克風幾乎收不到聲音：%@ 可能正在用這支麥克風做回音消除（例如用 Safari 開的 Google Meet），拾音收不到你的聲音。請改用 Chrome 開會，或讓會議和拾音用不同的麥克風。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The microphone is picking up almost nothing: %@ may be using this microphone for echo cancellation (for example Google Meet in Safari), so KelNote can’t hear you. Join the meeting in Chrome instead, or use different microphones for the meeting and KelNote."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "麦克风几乎收不到声音：%@ 可能正在用这个麦克风做回音消除（例如用 Safari 开的 Google Meet），拾音收不到你的声音。请改用 Chrome 开会，或让会议和拾音用不同的麦克风。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "麥克風幾乎收不到聲音：%@ 可能正在用這支麥克風做回音消除（例如用 Safari 開的 Google Meet），KelNote 收不到你的聲音。請改用 Chrome 開會，或讓會議和 KelNote 用不同的麥克風。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "麥克風幾乎收不到聲音：%@ 可能正在用這支麥克風做回音消除，拾音收不到你的聲音。請讓 %@ 和拾音用不同的麥克風。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The microphone is picking up almost nothing: %1$@ may be using this microphone for echo cancellation, so KelNote can’t hear you. Use different microphones for %2$@ and KelNote."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "麦克风几乎收不到声音：%@ 可能正在用这个麦克风做回音消除，拾音收不到你的声音。请让 %@ 和拾音用不同的麦克风。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "麥克風幾乎收不到聲音：%@ 可能正在用這支麥克風做回音消除，KelNote 收不到你的聲音。請讓 %@ 和 KelNote 用不同的麥克風。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
